            "review_text": "Van Phong\nHanoi, Vietnam1004 contributions\n0\nThat's normal Seafood Restaurant in Nha Trang, Seafoods are Fresh but not much, not various types\nMay 2018 • Family\nWe ate there in May holiday, Seafood is fresh, the area of Restaurant is not spacious, there are many dishes on the Menu but it does not mean you can order it, because there are many of those run out. it's hot to sit in the first floor, we have to wait for a long time to get taxi there, crowed outside, lot of local people there....that's cheap restaurant and good place with your tiny budget in Nha Trang, recommended and i highly appreciate \nThanks\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 25, 2018",
