            "review_text": "cathhchu\nDallas, Texas1 contribution\n0\nFresh seafood at a great price\nJul 2017 • Friends\nAlthough the menu is huge, they at least have english subtitles and lots of pictures. The staff speaks very little english but its not too hard to communicate through a little charades. However, if you do know Vietnamese or go with someone who does, the staff is great. The food is extremely fresh and nicely presented - one of the best seafood spots I have ever been to.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 28, 2017",
