            "review_text": "michvet3\nRiverview, Florida116 contributions\n0\nThe Best Seafood Hotpot in Vietnam!\nAfter traveling throughout Vietnam, I believe that nothing can come close to matching the lau hai son (seafood hotpot) of The Vuon Nha Restaurant in Nha Trang! The friendly staff and very affordable prices make a visit to this restaurant on the north side of the city an excellent choice. They also have a wide variety of seafood and many other items on their menu, ranging from beef and chicken cooked in a variety of ways, as well as many more traditional items, if you are after that perfect combination of Vietnamese foods. The food here is very fresh and tasty, so if you are out visiting the mudbath, or in the vicinity of Cu Chi Street, you won't regret stopping in at the Vuon Nho Restaurant!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 20, 2010",
